{"slug":"q-l-b","ar":"ق ل ب","total":168,"core":"heart; turning; overturning","forms":[{"ar":"قَلْب","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":132,"gloss":"Heart","word":"al-qalb","ex":{"s":79,"a":8,"p":1,"ar":["قُلُوبٌ","يَوْمَئِذٍ","وَاجِفَةٌ"],"en":"Hearts, that Day, will tremble"}},{"ar":"ٱنقَلَبَ","kind":"verb","form":7,"count":17,"gloss":"to turn back; to return","word":null,"ex":{"s":7,"a":119,"p":3,"ar":["فَغُلِبُوا۟","هُنَالِكَ","وَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","صَـٰغِرِينَ"],"en":"And Pharaoh and his people were overcome right there and became debased"}},{"ar":"قَلَّبُ","kind":"verb","form":2,"count":6,"gloss":"to turn about, alternate","word":null,"ex":{"s":24,"a":44,"p":1,"ar":["يُقَلِّبُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلَّيْلَ","وَٱلنَّهَارَ ۚ","إِنَّ","فِى","ذَٰلِكَ","لَعِبْرَةً","لِّأُو۟لِى","ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ"],"en":"Allah alternates the night and the day. Indeed in that is a lesson for those who have vision"}},{"ar":"تَقَلُّب","kind":"verbal noun","form":5,"count":5,"gloss":"movement; going about","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":219,"p":1,"ar":["وَتَقَلُّبَكَ","فِى","ٱلسَّـٰجِدِينَ"],"en":"And your movement among those who prostrate"}},{"ar":"مُنقَلِبُون","kind":"active participle","form":7,"count":3,"gloss":"returning","word":null,"ex":{"s":43,"a":14,"p":4,"ar":["وَإِنَّآ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّنَا","لَمُنقَلِبُونَ"],"en":"And indeed we, to our Lord, will [surely] return"}},{"ar":"مُنقَلَب","kind":"passive participle","form":7,"count":2,"gloss":"place of return","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":36,"p":12,"ar":["وَمَآ","أَظُنُّ","ٱلسَّاعَةَ","قَآئِمَةً","وَلَئِن","رُّدِدتُّ","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّى","لَأَجِدَنَّ","خَيْرًا","مِّنْهَا","مُنقَلَبًا"],"en":"And I do not think the Hour will occur. And even if I should be brought back to my Lord, I will surely find better than this as a return"}},{"ar":"مُتَقَلَّب","kind":"passive participle","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"place of movement","word":null,"ex":{"s":47,"a":19,"p":13,"ar":["فَٱعْلَمْ","أَنَّهُۥ","لَآ","إِلَـٰهَ","إِلَّا","ٱللَّهُ","وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","لِذَنۢبِكَ","وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","وَٱلْمُؤْمِنَـٰتِ ۗ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَعْلَمُ","مُتَقَلَّبَكُمْ","وَمَثْوَىٰكُمْ"],"en":"So know, [O Muhammad], that there is no deity except Allah and ask forgiveness for your sin and for the believing men and believing women. And Allah knows of your movement and your resting place"}},{"ar":"تَتَقَلَّبُ","kind":"verb","form":5,"count":1,"gloss":"to turn about","word":null,"ex":{"s":24,"a":37,"p":16,"ar":["رِجَالٌ","لَّا","تُلْهِيهِمْ","تِجَـٰرَةٌ","وَلَا","بَيْعٌ","عَن","ذِكْرِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَإِقَامِ","ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","وَإِيتَآءِ","ٱلزَّكَوٰةِ ۙ","يَخَافُونَ","يَوْمًا","تَتَقَلَّبُ","فِيهِ","ٱلْقُلُوبُ","وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ"],"en":"[Are] men whom neither commerce nor sale distracts from the remembrance of Allah and performance of prayer and giving of zakah. They fear a Day in which the hearts and eyes will [fearfully] turn about"}},{"ar":"تُقْلَبُ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":1,"gloss":"to be returned, turned back","word":null,"ex":{"s":29,"a":21,"p":8,"ar":["يُعَذِّبُ","مَن","يَشَآءُ","وَيَرْحَمُ","مَن","يَشَآءُ ۖ","وَإِلَيْهِ","تُقْلَبُونَ"],"en":"He punishes whom He wills and has mercy upon whom He wills, and to Him you will be returned"}}],"surahs":[[3,15],[9,15],[2,13],[33,11],[8,9],[22,8],[26,7],[5,6],[18,6],[48,6],[7,5],[47,5],[6,4],[16,4],[24,4],[39,3],[40,3],[49,3],[57,3],[59,3],[83,3],[4,2],[10,2],[13,2],[23,2],[50,2],[12,1],[15,1],[17,1],[21,1],[28,1],[29,1],[30,1],[34,1],[37,1],[41,1],[42,1],[43,1],[45,1],[58,1],[61,1],[63,1],[64,1],[66,1],[67,1],[74,1],[79,1],[84,1]]}